// Automatically estimated contacts from exported animation poses (PSA or AMP).
// Include ik_chains.qci first, then this file, BEFORE your sequences.
// Apply each cmdlist to its matching sequence/animation; no duplicate sequences are declared.
// Intentionally omit usesequence: blended animation inputs may have no first-slot owning sequence.
// Rules sample the processed animation, preserving loop/LX/LY/alignment commands.
// Ranges use inclusive zero-based SMD frames. Wrapped ranges remain one rule.
// These are motion-based estimates; inspect unusual/sliding/jumping clips.

// animations/APOLLO_Traders_A_AcceptQuest_00.smd : add cmdlist "arc_ik_apollo_traders_a_acceptquest_00" to its sequence/animation.
